SUMMARY SEMANTICS
-----------------
- effective_kind: determines summary kind from task status
- build(..., task_id=): task-scoped summary construction
- verify(): checks summary integrity against memory state
- --rebuild: reconstructs summary from store
- --verify: validates summary consistency

DERIVED NATURE
--------------
- Summaries are derived from task + memory state
- Not stored independently (no extra persistence)
- Rebuild from raw events is idempotent
- Adding new events can invalidate existing summary

